{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"10218","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:10218","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"窪岡俊之","creatorId":"vndb:s6027","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5537","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6027","name":"窪岡俊之","roleCode":"character-design","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:54909","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_177254","characterName":"高木 順一朗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"177254","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3272"},{"characterId":"177254","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"高木 順一朗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"55"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0706"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"73"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"通称「社長」。『1st Vision』および『DS』での765プロダクション代表取締役で、プロデューサーや小鳥直属の上司に相当する。本編ではシルエットのみ現れるが、765プロダクション公式サイトの会社案内では顔写真が公開されている。かつてはプロデューサーを務めていたことがあり、最初にプロデュースしたアイドルは「ワンダーモモ」と語っている。自分自身のルールとして絆を重視しているが、皮肉にもそれが社長の過去にまつわる悲劇にも繋がっているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族構成に関しては漫画『ブレイク!』の主人公である孫・高木祐太郎と、『2』以降社長職を引き継ぐ従兄弟・高木順二朗がいること以外は不明。性格は威厳を感じさせる一方、コミカルでお調子者なはっちゃけた一面も見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『SP』のパーフェクトサンとワンダリングスターの通常EDでは、黒井社長から「彼女らのことはあきらめたらどうだ」と言われているが、小鳥を含めた「彼女ら」についての詳細は不明ながら、真EDで過去の話として少しだけ触れられており、それが前述の悲劇に関わっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『DS』では登場しないものの、765プロが業界屈指の有名プロダクションにのし上がったのは彼の手腕であると評されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なお、Xbox 360版では、毎月初週の挨拶や星井美希イベントでのゲスト出演などで、最も多くセリフが追加されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり表には出てこないが、ライブイベントの際には度々おなじみのシルエットと共に声だけで出演している。ゲーム中でもライブ会場に姿を見せるのは最後のコンサートだけである。2008年1月に『MASTER ARTIST』シリーズ10巻購入特典でプレゼントされた社長のフィギュア（キューブリック）も、いつものシルエット同様真っ黒だった（なお、台紙はゲーム本編に登場する初代765プロ社屋、もとい雑居ビルのペーパークラフトになっている）。ウェブラジオでの発言によると、社長が色黒なのは事実らしく、「みのさんにも負けない」とのこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『L4U!』には別の仕事に行っている設定であるため直接登場はしないが、一部のアイドラに登場するほか、社長と音無小鳥がメインのアイドラ「おはよう諸君!」も配信された。初回特典のOVAには登場しない。『SP』予約特典で配布された着せ替えジャケットには「（雪歩の字が）小さくて読めない」と書かれており、音無小鳥のメッセージで「年のせいでは?」とツッコミを入れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲーム以外でもシルエットだったり体の一部が写ったりするのみだが、漫画『ブレイク!』では全身をはっきりと見せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『2』では会長となり、従兄の順二朗に社長の座を任せ、765プロのために日本各地を転々としている。また、PS3版『2』の初回限定版や『G4U!』に付属している「月刊アイグラ!!」の人生相談コーナーにも登場。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレビアニメ版では登場せず、特に順一朗会長について語られてはいないが、劇場版パンフレットの順二朗社長の紹介においてその存在が触れられている。ただし、「前社長」であるとされているだけで、特にその活動などについては触れられていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"177254"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"兴趣","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"177254","value":"カゲ踏みとクレナフレックス"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9c2dd17defa39f9b671a758b66b233424cadfc602134c80fab5b3c8d2aff41d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e73d309439a6df941e0984082998b02e230605e9ecf4b3f6f325c68a01348f7.webp","width":139,"height":122,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5922","characterName":"あまみ はるか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5922","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5922","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"あまみ はるか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0403"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"偶像大师系列游戏与动画的第一主角，属于Vocal阵营。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独生女，工薪阶层出身，有一个比较幸福的家庭。从小喜欢唱歌和制作点心，性格乐观、上进且待人友善，跟事务所众人都能合得来，但有时也会在情绪高涨时候不知所措，而且极度害怕孤独，感情观念相当保守。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经常在平坦的地面摔倒，反而在陡峭的地方不会有事，略微有些天然呆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成为偶像的原因：为了实现自己的儿时梦想。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为CV的缘故，二次设定里有里人格“春阁下”，此时瞳孔会变红。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏中基本数据平均但是舞蹈能力稍低，相对的唱歌能力略高，情绪容易控制，适合新人上手使用。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作的主人公，身高158cm、B83/W56/H80、16岁。以为参加偶像选拔参加了蒙登金特的面试。超不擅长理科科目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是充满朝气的女孩。做事全凭直觉，性格开朗不过自己觉得错误的事情就绝对不会同意。拜头上醒目的蝴蝶结丝带所赐得到了一个奇怪的绰号 。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5922"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/045684601e31ac753ee548dbd2fef14a46ce170dc55b9f7448442d3c61da84de.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/092d3ff8d80d146e26e0e12da7a836f2a3ad49acf24ce046d361e49e5c8b5a7c.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村繪里子","creatorId":"vndb:s1648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1648","name":"中村 繪里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5922:4991:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5923","characterName":"Mami Futami","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5923","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5923","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Mami Futami","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0522"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属偶像中最年少的双胞胎。个性差异不大而好作怪。从绑头发的位置可以分辨两人（以制作人的角度，向左绑的是亚美，向右绑的是真美，二代设定真美的绑发留长为马尾）。两人宣称轮替著从事演艺活动，但游戏中实际上台的只有亚美。父亲是医师，因为行医而和母亲相遇。称呼制作人为“兄ちゃん（哥哥）”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值是全角色里最差不过情绪管理容易。初期会因为能力过低而相当辛苦，不过衰退缓慢所以终盘会变强。但是在组成双人与三人团体时，若不和她们对谈的话情绪值会大幅降低，所以和情绪管理不易的角色组队时需要特别注意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初始设定亚美为姐姐，真美为妹妹，XBOX 360版及SP版变更设定，真美为姐姐，性格比亚美较为稳重有责任感；亚美为妹妹，性格比真美较为自由活泼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双海亚美的双胞胎妹妹，iDOL “TEMPESTAS”的MASTER。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"7年前的事故中受了重伤并随TEMPESTAS一同失踪。在TEMPESTAS的驾驶舱中治愈伤口并陷入长眠，因此其精神层面没有生长，虽然身体跟亚美一样是12岁的模样，但是精神年龄还停留在5岁。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5923"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebe8b13a137e505a44414d9aa582d5e33435da0fc488ab88dde8af25ce559406.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60195f5ccc78cf2ef783012880da03bd125826e218b1f0a652a90f7902673ba1.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下田麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s1597","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1597","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1597","name":"下田 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5923:4990:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5924","characterName":"みうら あずさ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5924","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5924","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"みうら あずさ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0719"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在所属偶像中最为年长，且胸部丰满。天然而沉着的治愈系大姐姐，不过是个严重的路痴。在设定上比制作人年长，制作人与爱好者都称她为“あずささん”。志愿偶像的理由是“为了和命运中人相遇”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高168cm、B86/W57/H84、20岁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春香她们从属的Mondenkind iDOL Master课的iDOL小队的主任。原本也是iDOL Master的姐姐，对春香她们非常温柔，什么事情都可以找她相谈。性格冷静沉着，无论什么时候都能保持冷静。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5924"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7aef064a9cea31cfdc8b85423fcbcd818f2bea564b604f85c05b6016b08a5eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfa2f1c8af6000096975051fd5874d8611db4fc009724bd4da5865eac7a42915.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5924:4604:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5925","characterName":"水瀬 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5925","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5925","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"水瀬 伊織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0505"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"和有气质的外表正好相反，相当任性，蛮横娇羞型。非常讨厌输给别人。因父亲和765 Production的社长是朋友而透过关系进入演艺界。对2位哥哥怀有强烈的自卑感与竞争心理。经常随身带着兔子的玩偶，口癖是“にひひ!”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值高且易于管理情绪，和律子同様是“好用强角色”。似乎因为如此有许多人会让律子和伊织组成双人团体来争取排名。另外在双人、三人的时候，若不慎选谈话的对手会大幅影响心情，需要特别注意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高156cm、B77/W54/H79、16岁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和春香、雪步是同校生兼室友。宽额头就是其最大的特征。总是自信满满的样子，喜欢毫不保留地直接说出自己的想法，事实上非常努力。而且因为她那闪亮到可以反光的额头，所以有着“小凸”的绰号。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5925"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/212faeb1760c2cf7774609589c86f4fb669a040fb0457625025de945cef52523.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24ae9d5aadd1c945e9587cc2e5e05ff788ebfd674a8356b0beaf5fcc113b3927.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"釘宮理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s500","name":"釘宮理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5925:3936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5926","characterName":"たかつき やよい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5926","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5926","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"たかつき やよい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0325"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"145"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"765事务所中最穷的偶像，属于Dance阵营，为六个子女中的老大，很早就开始作为姐姐照顾全家。父亲为自由职业者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"个性活泼开朗，爱护家庭的好孩子，但家中经济似乎不太好，在事务所里常常帮忙打扫与倒垃圾。因为设定上没有手机，只有在培育期间和事务所借用，引退以后就不会寄信件回来。不太会撒娇，说话略微有点大舌头，并且有恐高症，对待弟弟妹妹们非常有姐姐的形象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对钱看得非常敏感，二次设定中一旦陷入经济危机很可能会黑化。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成为偶像的原因：为了全家人的生计。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值虽低，但情绪管理容易且能力衰退的速度也慢，是新手也容易操作的角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高154cm、体重44kg、B87/W56/H82。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超喜欢可爱的事物，天真烂漫的15岁少女，与春香从小学开始就是要好的朋友。梦想是成为一个大明星。现在是某个电台节目的主播。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5926"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e2935e839349584fb6c895122a0c29655388f1a532a23dea0ed9e37b708edd2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44e9fa4332b46bdb949e33b1fb63e28d184699b682ac5dfd9ffeb16dfd0c26a5.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"仁後真耶子","creatorId":"vndb:s12931","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12931","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12931","name":"仁後 真耶子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5926:5442:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5927","characterName":"あきずき りつこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5927","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5927","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"あきずき りつこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0623"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静沉着思考清晰的眼镜娘。凡事会清楚表达自己的意见。在事务所里除了偶像工作外，也兼任文书的职务。在2代和电视动画篇，专职于小组“龙宫小町”的事务工作，游戏“全力以赴”之后重新回归偶像工作，设定和初代一样为人手不足。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来是以事务员工作的，但由于人手不足被推选为候补之一。通晓关于秋叶原的事情，似乎对跟自己名字相仿的秋月电子颇中意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值高情绪也容易管理，属于所谓的“好用强角色（お手軽強キャラ）”在初期时很强。不过能力容易衰退，终盘时会遭遇苦战。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高165cm、B87/W57/H83、18岁。IDOL整备组组长之一，也是春香等人所住的宿舍“十六夜寮”的宿舍长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为春香她们的前辈的大姐，喜欢各种机器和机械的发明家。性格直率爽朗，恶趣味就是给别人取绰号，而且还爱搞恶作剧。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5927"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3aa5ec91ab445b4385162134901f2f2d91c84dc24c80cf92d5cc39f17bfe7751.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/1603769a7fdac84240420c841cd5abdf5a8af1533421aeb8c977f72d2130dcb9.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若林直美","creatorId":"vndb:s446","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s446","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s446","name":"若林 直美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5927:3934:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_5928","characterName":"きさらぎ ちはや","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"5928","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"5928","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"きさらぎ ちはや","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0225"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"72"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"41"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"偶像大师系列游戏与动画三巨头之一，Vocal阵营的队长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中产阶级出身，弟弟·如月优8年前因车祸死亡，目前父母离异，自己独居中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蓝色及腰长发，身体纤细挺拔，但胸围非常小，经常会不自觉的吐槽胸围，并且对胸围较大的人有一定抵触情绪。性格非常认真，有时候会很死板。拥有事务所最高超的演唱能力，本人也很喜爱唱歌，但对歌曲有着微妙的执着，对唱歌以外的其他工作有着明显的抵触情绪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为CV的原因，有痴女设定，控同事务所的高槻弥生达到了不像话的地步。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成为偶像的原因：弟弟生前极爱听她唱歌，于是音乐成为了她活下去的唯一动力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力以Vocal最为突出，同时其余两项能力水准也很高，名副其实的最强角色，但因为情绪管理难度过大，另一方面衰减较快，使用难度不低，甚至还有因为情绪低落和衰减造成的“千早螺旋”，不适合新手上手使用。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高167cm、体重47kg、B89/W55/H82、17岁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属对抗Mondenkind的组织Turiavita，是驾驶iDOL的皇牌驾驶员。品行正直，冷静沉着，言行有礼，总是流露出典雅的气质。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"5928"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7dcab06093de296281d9d642742a0c7251fc677d3deb1197eefc2d07a1af4fb7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/472c39da6a98ba33dcf3132059e37607ad5bf9e14042f47f44a08d7c8493d2ac.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今井麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s240","name":"今井 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:5928:4061:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_7191","characterName":"萩原雪歩","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"7191","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"7191","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"萩原雪歩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1224"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"登场作品：街机、XBOX版（1，2代）、PSP版、动画版、PS4版"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格：沉着，形象颜色：白色"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生性爱哭而胆小，为了改变自己的个性而目标当上偶像。喜欢喝茶（尤其是抹茶）。似乎对身材没有自信，本人也说自己是“没肉、贫乳、小不点（ひんそーでひんにゅーでちんちくりんで）”，不过数字上并没有很差。极度消沉时会习惯在地上挖个洞把自己埋起来，所以电钻和铲子成为了雪歩的代表物（真的埋起来还是在脑内埋起来则详细不明）。在动画初期似乎很害怕男人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值且容易陷入低潮，单人时最难以掌控。不过因为能力值容易提升且衰退缓慢，持之以恒地培育后会是大器晚成型的角色。初期虽然会陷于苦战但终盘时会展现压倒性的实力。此外还拥有隐藏要素绝对不会临时取消之特性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从2代开始，其配音落合祐里香由于工作档期原因退出策划，于是更换为浅仓杏美。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天海春香的管制官，身高158cm、B88/W55/H83、16岁。和春香一样通过了iDOL MASTER的选拔来到东京。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内心很温柔的女孩，一直想改变羞怯畏缩的性格去成为一个积极的人。春香的同级生，有着到哪都能睡着的本事，一般注意到她时，她都在睡觉。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"7191"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e025c88301fb6e72fa14d8e7db8921a8142252c5dfae7f026a7f6a25218a2d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c1a9d4e4f54c7e756be81f5d51faf0178f9ff82d9e48d4640bc3104bd82b4b1.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_7192","characterName":"Ami Futami","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"7192","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"7192","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Ami Futami","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0522"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属偶像中最年少的双胞胎。个性差异不大而好作怪。从绑头发的位置可以分辨两人（以制作人的角度，向左绑的是亚美，向右绑的是真美，二代设定真美的绑发留长为马尾）。两人宣称轮替著从事演艺活动，但游戏中实际上台的只有亚美。父亲是医师，因为行医而和母亲相遇。称呼制作人为“兄ちゃん（哥哥）”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值是全角色里最差不过情绪管理容易。初期会因为能力过低而相当辛苦，不过衰退缓慢所以终盘会变强。但是在组成双人与三人团体时，若不和她们对谈的话情绪值会大幅降低，所以和情绪管理不易的角色组队时需要特别注意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初始设定亚美为姐姐，真美为妹妹，XBOX 360版及SP版变更设定，真美为姐姐，性格比亚美较为稳重有责任感；亚美为妹妹，性格比真美较为自由活泼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（在偶像大师XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高148cm、B74/W53/H73、12岁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真真正正活跃在演艺圈的偶像。虽然是小学生，无论是态度还是判断力都表现得相当成熟。7年前的事件中，她的双胞胎妹妹真美失踪了，伤心的亚美离开了Mondenkind而专心投入演艺圈。对于回归的她，可是整备人员的老前辈。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"7192"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9665b5f63f14a71475f3738f5d0561c64f98a08a1be60834cf0768772e42210.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f91a20f65acb559677308992f1f3494f5eaec8764919aab60f66610e8ba84c4d.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下田麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s1597","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1597","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1597","name":"下田 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:484:7192:4990:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_7193","characterName":"菊地 真","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"7193","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"211088"},{"characterId":"7193","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"484"}]},"originalCharacterName":"菊地 真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0829"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男孩子气的女孩。 运动神经超群，乍看之下会以为是美少年，但本人希望有女人味，为了外表与内在的差距而烦恼著。游戏中女性爱好者比男性要多。有着小心谨慎的一面。父亲是赛车手，而她也曾有一段时期被当作未来的赛车手来栽培，曾经驾驶过卡丁车。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢看少女漫画和收集可爱的东西，意外的有着胆小的一面，不擅长应付昆虫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"亚美、真美称呼其为“まこちん”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"遇到好事时有“へへっ、やっりぃ〜”的口头禅。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本能力值略为偏高且易于情绪管理，和春香同様适合新手。此外街机版的收录曲之中，BPM値最高的是她的‘エージェント夜を往く’。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(在偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA中）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高163cm、B78/W56/H76、16岁。为iDOL“NEBULA”的MASTER，不相信iDOL有感情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才机师，性格冷漠。自生下来便开始接受训练，只要一坐上iDOL驾驶座，就能上演杰出的表演。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"7193"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df994c34500992efde1c10a77b2f75756587fe533a0eee480010dfa70263a43c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images